      "title": "The spectral gap on both sides of zero in one noncompact position",
      "hypotheses": "V is an irreducible compact type of highest weight L=μ+ρn−ρc. The coordinates of μ strictly decrease and all opposite-sign gaps are at least h>nrs+1.",
